Audience ai prompt library
title end

paragraph start
The first prompt groups collected comments into problems.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
Read the notation usage guide and the problems and desires pages first.
I give you a list of comments with their source.
Group the comments that describe the same problem.
For each group give a count, one plain sentence and one exact example.
Mark any comment you cannot place as unplaced.
Do not add problems that are not in the comments.
Stop after the list.
code end

